### D. Research into mathematics education

Math Lab may investigate questions about how students learn mathematics and which educational approaches support understanding.

Potential research topics include:

- Mathematical misconceptions.
- Alternative explanations.
- Problem-solving strategies.
- Mathematical confidence and participation.
